meta {
  name: Open Payments
  seq: 2
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  The same scenarios as Admin, driven the way a client drives them — through
  the Open Payments API. Setup still goes through Admin: assets, wallet
  addresses, peers and liquidity are operator concerns a client cannot create.

  Node A reaches Node B by its resource id, which is a URL carrying Node B's
  advertised address. Bruno itself reaches both nodes on localhost, so its own
  GETs rebuild the URL from the id's last segment.
}
